  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "Such is the fear you instill in your minions that when in your presence, they would rather die than disappoint you. Once per encounter, as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a> to one of your minions being moved down the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Condition_Track\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition Track\">Condition Track</a>, you can reduce the number of steps the minion moves down the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Condition_Track\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition Track\">Condition Track</a> by 1. Additionally, the target regains Hit Points equal to your Heroic Level. If the target is reduced to 0 Hit Points or moved to the bottom of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Condition_Track\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition Track\">Condition Track</a>, you cannot use this Talent on that target.",
